Hi Inna,

You need to set your working directory to where you downloaded the “CODEX_0.99.11.tar.gz” file.

setwd(“C:\Users\inna.mittal\Download”) # if you downloaded in the Download folder in your windows 8 system

install.packages("CODEX_0.99.11.tar.gz", repos = NULL, type = "source”)

Yuchao

